Third-party material shipped in the Moonwater image

Everything in this file is separate from the project's own code and is under
its own licence, not the project's. The project's licence is in
.github/LICENSE and does not apply to the files below, and nothing here
changes it.


Fonts

Eight font files are shipped, unmodified, as the projects released them: the
bytes in fonts/ are the bytes in the release archives, not subset, not
converted, not renamed inside (the SIL Open Font License's rule on Reserved
Font Names concerns modified versions, and there are none). The build copies
them, with each family's licence text beside them, into the image under
/usr/share/fonts/ (fonts/inter/ to /usr/share/fonts/inter/, and likewise
fonts/ibm-plex-mono/, fonts/noto-sans-arabic/ and fonts/noto-sans-hebrew/).
They are TrueType outlines (glyf), static instances, which is what
src/canvas/font.c reads. The Noto files are the unhinted builds of their
releases, 317,728 bytes for the four: the engine draws unhinted, and the hinted
builds of the same fonts are 550,072 bytes.

Licence of all four families: SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (26 February
2007), the text kept next to each family's files as OFL.txt, exactly as the
project ships it. The fonts are not sold by themselves; the licence text and
the copyright notice travel with them.


